<title>USA: EXCO Resources 9 months net loss widens.</title>
<headline>EXCO Resources 9 months net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>			 9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss $0.43		    N/A</p>
<p> Net	   loss   329	  loss   $279</p>
<p> Revs		1,050		     751</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: EXCO Resources Inc said the most significant portion of the 1996 loss, $302,907, or $0.40 per share, resulted from the costs associated with the attempted acquisition of Taurus Energy Corp. The company was not available to comment on its third quarter earnings or its earnings per share for the first nine months of 1995.</p>
